{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "main_14_level_main_14-01_beg",
  "groupId": "main_14",
  "stageId": "main_14-01",
  "title": "Operation Meeting",
  "storyCode": "14-2",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_14-01_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "1212de8115b558ae5be8840036939ff9b4981dd0cfa609ed8cd8be452fc4229a",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Thirty minutes earlier...\nUnderground structure, Highbury Borough, Londinium"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Londinium Worker A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You're back. How are things up top?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Londinium Worker B",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Same as ever. Maybe worse."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Londinium Worker B",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I used to be scared of those devil mercenaries who ask you for a smoke. The worst you'll get is a slap on the face if they feel like it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Londinium Worker B",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But now? It's all monsters you can't even describe that'll turn you into a puddle of blood without so much as blinking."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Londinium Worker B",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You know what? I've been sleeping better. Because I know there's nothing but death if I run into one of them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Londinium Worker A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Are the Sarkaz still grabbing workers off the streets?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Londinium Worker B",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Didn't see anything. We didn't dare go too far. Doesn't seem like the Sarkaz are interested in running the city anymore. There's no one maintaining public order."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Londinium Worker B",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "They couldn't fully occupy Londinium, could they? What use is it to them? Are they really planning to drive the Victorian capital all the way back to Kazdel?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Londinium Worker A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Who knows? Honestly, I haven't a clue what they're trying to do. Why go through so much trouble if they just want to kill everyone?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catherine",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How sad. Those who betrayed their friends for a better future are soon betrayed by the better future."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Londinium Worker B",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Londinium Worker A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No one expected things to turn out like this. You know we didn't mean to..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catherine",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Let me guess—you mean us no harm but handed us to the Defense Forces out of fear. How kind and gentle. You all deserve a medal."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Londinium Worker B",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Catherine, we..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catherine",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Save it. I don't have time to dig up old grudges, not that it would help anything anyway. At least you didn't gift wrap my head and Feist's and give them to the Sarkaz."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catherine",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The question is, what do we do now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Londinium Worker A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We can hide here. We know the underground passages better than the Sarkaz—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catherine",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That's your plan, Tommy? Live underground for the rest of your life like a talpibeast? Why don't you just go hide in a coffin, then?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catherine",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I don't blame you for what you did. Given a choice, no one wants to go to war. But war is here now, right here in our homes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catherine",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "There's nowhere to run."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catherine",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I ran into a few fellows who said they could get us some decent weapons. I reckon—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Londinium Worker A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Is that thunder?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Londinium Worker B",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Rain would be really nice right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Londinium Worker A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Why is it shaking? Is Londinium on the move?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Londinium Worker A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But the mobility level is—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catherine",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Something's not right."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catherine",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Let's head up and see what's happening. Be careful."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catherine",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Londinium Worker A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What is it, Catherine? You're blocking the window."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The massive silhouette of The Shard is just visible from here.\nThe most familiar sight and the pride of all who call Londinium home.\nBut the annoying yet comforting blankets of clouds above are nowhere to be seen."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catherine",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wait... What's that on top of the Shard?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catherine",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Take all our supplies and contact everyone we can. We need to move deeper underground now!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catherine",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hurry!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Fifteen minutes earlier...\nSilverrock Bluffs, Londinium Outskirts"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Duke of Caster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We're approaching Silverrock Bluffs... That means the attacks will start soon."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Duke of Caster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "When I first heard Wellington's plan a few days ago..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Duke of Caster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Do you know what my initial reaction was?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Flag Officer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You thought it was too ambitious, your Grace?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Duke of Caster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ambitious? I think you mean <i>crazy</i>."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Flag Officer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yes... crazy. He wants the entire allied forces committed to the front lines — thirteen dreadnoughts, forty-five assault ships, one hundred seventy-two gunboats..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Flag Officer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Eighty-six transports, ten support ships, all our artillery, and one hundred eighty thousand infantry, including the entire reserves."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Flag Officer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It wasn't an inquiry or request. It was a notice, almost an order."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Flag Officer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The Duke of Wellington has also abandoned the traditional Gaulish formation of multiple battle lines, instead having all fleets form single files to penetrate the Nachzehrer line all at once."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Flag Officer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Gododdin and our forces are to be responsible for fire support and clearing out casters in the Sarkaz rear, while Wellington's vanguard charges at the center of the Nachzehrer formation."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Flag Officer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The Silverrock Bluffs, currently under Sarkaz control, is a key pass between the Redmane Mountains and the Duskglow River, and a highly defensible position."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Flag Officer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The enemy can easily retreat towards Londinium, even if we win the battle."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Flag Officer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I would have staunchly opposed the plan, if it was not Wellington who proposed it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Duke of Caster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But you and the rest of the high commanders eventually consented to it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Flag Officer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We've seen similar tactics in the military academies. They were the same tactics used in that legendary battle of the War of the Four Nations, in which Duke Wellington fought."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Flag Officer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The Victoria and Leithanien alliance split the Gaulish lines into three and quashed their resistance."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Flag Officer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That battle put Victorian on a new course for the next several decades."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Duke of Caster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Glorious as it may be, the past is no place to find refuge in."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Flag Officer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Do you also think the Iron Duke has grown old?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Duke of Caster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wellington is a military genius."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Duke of Caster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "He commands battleships with the same ease and grace as a Leithanian virtuoso. I have never seen anyone quite like him."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Duke of Caster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "He is not one of those fools blindly chasing the glory of the past."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Duke of Caster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The Sarkaz is not the end, but merely the beginning of the end of the real battle."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Duke of Caster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "As for here and now..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Duke of Caster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's not just Wellington who needs a decisive victory."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Flag Officer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The Sarkaz have the Shard, and they have successfully fired it before. They could attack us or anywhere in Victoria at any moment."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Flag Officer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "However, our war scholars deem any losses from Sarkaz Catastrophe attacks to be within acceptable limits."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Flag Officer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Those losses will not compromise our ability to achieve our strategic objective."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Flag Officer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The Sarkaz have not refueled Londinium since it deviated from course. The city is immobile as of now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Flag Officer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Once we take the pass at Silverrock Bluffs, the Sarkaz will no longer have a terrain advantage, and the allied fleets will have a clear path to Londinium."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Flag Officer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Indeed, if everything goes well–"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Duke of Caster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We will be able to end this meaningless stalemate as quickly as possible."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Duke of Caster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yet the word 'stalemate' isn't an apt description for the Sarkaz and Victoria."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Duke of Caster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Telegrams from the Caster hold are increasingly impatient. One cannot fault our backers for it. War is far too expensive."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Duke of Caster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "A promise fulfilled too late is a promise unfulfilled."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Flag Officer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Are those the cannons of <i>Gastrell</i> going off?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Flag Officer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The Duke of Wellington's attack has begun? But it's not time yet."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Flag Officer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Your Grace, what's that red light coming from the distance?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Flag Officer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That light! It's coming from the top of the Shard!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Duke of Caster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hail Wellington right now! We must—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "...",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "Ouch...",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Doctor! Are you okay?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "The Doctor will be fine. Mon3tr absorbed the brunt of the impact."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Where are we?",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "How are the others?",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "The good news is that we fell into a canyon. Our precise location is uncertain, but we're at least a distance from the worst of the fighting."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Closure, Horn, and Siege have gone out to scout our surroundings. You should be briefed on the specifics soon."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "We're still assessing our personnel and equipment losses. Preliminary reports indicate that pre-impact measures were effective and losses are acceptable. Medical and engineering units are already at work."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "I'm afraid there's been some troubling development."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "The sky...",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "It's red.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Watch your step and keep up with us, Doctor."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "Suffering extends its reach to every corner the eye can see.\nFrom the top of the Shard, Originium spreads like a plague, devouring... assimilating.\nBuildings, ships, armies... Originium devours all and quickly expands.\nAn unprecedented calamity indeed, one that puts even the most terrifying Catastrophes to shame.\nAnd yet, an army marches through the roiling Originium crystals, its tattered banner visible even from here.\nSuffering is but a marching order for the Sarkaz.\nThe ever-hungry procession of Sarkaz advances to the horns of wailing...\nSinking their teeth and claws into any enemy they find."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "Blood-stained boulders litter the wasteland as far as the eye can see, looking decidedly out of place.\nThe whipping winds have ceased, giving way to a rising fog.\nThe withered grass remains unstirred, yet countless tattered bandages already dangle across.\nSarkaz warriors stand in line, soundless and motionless.\nWaiting for the embodiment of death and decay, the master of war, their king.\nA withered figure emerges from the death-filled fog."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Nezzsalem",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Nezzsalem",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Duq'arael, Regent's Crimson, Prince of Blood."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Nezzsalem",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "We were never close."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Nezzsalem",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "But the contribution that you and your blood made to the war is undeniable."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Nezzsalem",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "I bear witness to your glory and shame."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Nezzsalem",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Slayer of the Feranmut in the Mist, Jailer of Time."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Nezzsalem",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Usurper of the Royal Court, Executioner of Kings."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Nezzsalem",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "You denied the path that we now walk, as you've denied the meaning of the Black Crown—"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Nezzsalem",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "But you gave your first and final drop of blood to the Sarkaz."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Nezzsalem",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Your power shall not fade away, nor shall your anger, your hatred, your ambition."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "He spreads his arms wide.\nA black fog of decay rises, swallowing every boulder.\nRed fades into sand and dirt, vanishing into the mist.\nThe warriors do not speak, but the earth begins to rumble as ancient witchcraft spreads across the battlefield."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Salus",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "...This is the Blood of Teekaz."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Salus",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "It evoked the call of Amnannam, but was lost in the battle's Arts Circles. The Confessarii searched seventy of them without finding it."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Salus",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "But Nezzsalem, Your Highness, you have found it for the Regent."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "The drop of red liquid drifts toward Salus and enters her wrist."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Nezzsalem",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Keep it safe, Confessarius."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Salus",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Of course. I vow to protect it with all the strength of my bloodline... my life."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Salus",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "The Vampiric Arts Circles are still active..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Salus",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "What of the Sanguinarch of Vampires? The purest bloodline, the cruelest of the sovereigns, the pride of the Sarkaz."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Salus",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Did he really die so easily? At the hands of the young Banshee and the rabbit?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Nezzsalem",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "He has not joined the myriad souls, but away has he drifted."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Salus",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "What a shame to waste so much blood."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Nezzsalem",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Meddler of bloodlines. Do not desecrate war and death with your flippant insolence."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Salus",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Um..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Salus",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Apologies, your Highness, I was merely lamenting the loss of the Sanguinarch."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Nezzsalem",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Then keep his legacy safe."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Nezzsalem",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "His blood will continue the fight with us."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Salus",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Of that, I have no doubt, Sovereign of the Withered Court."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Salus",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "The Blood of Teekaz will fulfill its duty. If a mere tremble of Amnannam is enough to burn the heaven red and bring upheaval to the earth..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Salus",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Then its final descent shall free our fate from the manipulation of Originium, as the myriad souls have so longed for."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Nezzsalem",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Fate?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Nezzsalem",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "War will crush all obstacles beneath its heel, even fate."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "The Deadwood Throne rises, attended by innumerable war altars, casting a massive shadow on the battlefield.\nSilent columns of warriors step into the strange Catastrophe, continuing their advance."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Nezzsalem",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "We will advance before the storm."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Nezzsalem",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Both the living and the dead—"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Nezzsalem",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "This war belongs to all Sarkaz."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "A new beginning."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Young Officer",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Another quote from one of the sovereigns, general?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "...No."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "I was simply reminded of the furnace at the center of Kazdel."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Young Officer",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Oh, the big one. I witnessed many feedings before I came to Londinium."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Young Officer",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "It is an honor for a fallen warrior to be fed into it, becoming the fire that propels our progress."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Young Officer",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "But it never seems to be sated. Small wonder. The flames of a revenant's rage only burn stronger."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Nadine... would you call the nomadic city by the name of Kazdel your <i>home</i>?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Nadine",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "What is the meaning behind the question, sir, when the final battle has already begun?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Nadine",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "I was raised on the battlefields outside Kazdel. The black rocks and the bones of my fellow Nachzehrer are the only things buried beneath the city's walls and wheels."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Nadine",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Where is home, if not Kazdel?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Yes... What other answer could there be?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "The future is lined with uncertainties, but this much we know: this war ends where a new beginning emerges."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Have you made contact with Ulšulah?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Nadine",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "No. They were very thorough in mopping up Brentwood."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Nadine",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Just as you predicted, our casters have picked up the trail of the Feranmut skeleton's movement. They considered attacking Londinium... attacking The Shard directly."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "I gave them a chance... far too many chances."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Nadine",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "There is no question that Major Ulšulah has been negligent in her duty. She had better have a good explanation... if she lives to explain."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Have you located the skeleton?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Nadine",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "We have a rough idea of its location, but it will take time to find it on this vast battlefield. Should I take a squad there personally?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "No. I will."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "We will retake the Feranmut's spine, or destroy it. It must not fall into the wrong hands again."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Nadine",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "You're going yourself?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Those mercenaries have interfered too much. They must be eliminated."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Before that, though... we will finish the ritual."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Nadine",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Our Nachzehrer ritual? I didn't think you cared much for tradition."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Cyclops, Lich, Wendigo, Banshee... more and more have left."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "You've never seen these Royal Courts in Kazdel, have you, young Nachzehrer?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Nadine",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "I suppose not. Other than the Nachzehrer, it's mostly been Vampires. Not the best neighbors, but you start to miss their smell when you spend enough time in Londinium."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "The blood of the fallen has returned to the earth."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "There will be no new Prince of the Crimson Court."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "How many sovereigns do the Sarkaz have left?"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "'Bzzzz—'\n'Logistics to Command. We've encountered a Catastrophe near Sufrior Chasm.'\n'At least, I think it's a Catastrophe... we're being drowned in a tide of Originium.'\n'The ship has lost power. Weapon systems severely damaged... all systems inoperative!'\n'Defense systems offline... no response from Arts unit... I repeat, all systems inoperative...'\n'Enemy spotted! Taking heavy fire, mobile Arts device... *Bzzt*...'\n'Data... automatic record...'"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "None of these messages made it out."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "The entire communications system is scrap. To think that so many have died to protect this little metal box..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "...I salute you."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Phew... that bow hurt. I shouldn't take my hat off..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Our foe is unpredictable, aren't they? There's enough intel about The Shard to fill an entire building."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "But you and I must take the blame for our present circumstances."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "The man in a hat looks down at his counterpart.\nThe man on the ground lies motionless, buried to his chest in crystal-filled dirt. But the little box that he clutches in his left hand remains spotless.\nThe Trilby Asher pulls the rim of his fallen comrade's hat down, covering the face that no one knew to begin with.\nIt took a little more effort to retrieve the communicator, but war has made him a rather proficient undertaker."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Intel retrieved."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Communications are still being jammed by severe interference."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "A little progress is better than nothing, I suppose."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "'The Duke of Fife and the Sixth Infantry Battalion were ambushed. The landing attempt on the Crumley plate has failed.'\n'Unable to reach the Duke of Gododdin's scout fleet. Chetleigh has been lost.'\n'Large-scale unanticipated geological changes across the Silverrock Bluffs front. Active Originium concentration above threshold.'"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "No good news."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Are those... troops?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "The ID code is—"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "My, my... what a miracle. I am a lucky man indeed."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Hm?"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
